WEBVTT

00:00:00.274 --> 00:00:03.174
It's pretty awesome, invincible power!

00:00:03.574 --> 00:00:06.444
Boy, does it feel great

00:00:06.814 --> 00:00:09.574
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:00:10.014 --> 00:00:13.184
Come on, let's head for tomorrow!

00:00:15.124 --> 00:00:16.254
Zettai Karen Children

00:00:16.254 --> 00:00:17.424
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:00:17.424 --> 00:00:18.694
Zettai Karen Children
Absolutely!

00:00:18.694 --> 00:00:20.364
Zettai Karen Children

00:00:20.364 --> 00:00:21.384
Zettai Karen Children
Daring!

00:00:21.564 --> 00:00:24.864
It just takes a touch for me to know

00:00:24.864 --> 00:00:27.294
The limiter on my heart

00:00:28.034 --> 00:00:30.734
Has been released, and then you see

00:00:31.134 --> 00:00:34.334
Yes! Change the world!

00:00:34.574 --> 00:00:37.444
Trying again and again through hot battle!

00:00:37.744 --> 00:00:41.044
Reaching through what's real

00:00:41.044 --> 00:00:44.284
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:00:44.284 --> 00:00:47.224
The thrills just can't be beat!

00:00:48.354 --> 00:00:54.824
Courage begins to light the
darkness of the world

00:00:54.824 --> 00:01:00.764
It overflows with the miracles you gave

00:01:01.204 --> 00:01:05.604
If you can take pride in a smile

00:01:05.604 --> 00:01:07.594
That suits no one else

00:01:07.804 --> 00:01:12.344
Then let's go beyond the future now

00:01:12.344 --> 00:01:16.444
We can try over the future world!

00:01:16.684 --> 00:01:17.044
Yeah!

00:01:17.784 --> 00:01:18.444
Ultimate!

00:01:20.584 --> 00:01:21.814
Daring!

00:01:32.194 --> 00:01:34.694
3rd sense.
"The Virtuous Must Never Stray!
It's Tough to Be An Esper"

00:01:37.534 --> 00:01:37.974
REFINERY FIRE - Now Burning for 10 Hours

00:01:37.974 --> 00:01:41.104
It's been 10 hours since fire
broke out at this oil refinery,
REFINERY FIRE - Now Burning for 10 Hours

00:01:41.104 --> 00:01:43.014
with no sign of it being
extinguished any time soon.
REFINERY FIRE - Now Burning for 10 Hours

00:01:44.974 --> 00:01:47.614
Dammit, we're not getting anywhere!

00:01:47.614 --> 00:01:49.744
Stop the hoses! All men, pull back!

00:01:50.614 --> 00:01:52.514
Don't just stand there! Move it!

00:01:55.154 --> 00:01:57.054
Okay. Now, Kaoru!

00:01:57.054 --> 00:01:57.884
Roger!

00:02:04.634 --> 00:02:05.654
Wh-What the?!

00:02:21.714 --> 00:02:24.744
PSYCHIC DROP-LID!

00:02:34.924 --> 00:02:36.084
Wow...

00:02:38.464 --> 00:02:40.334
Shiho, how's it look inside?

00:02:44.274 --> 00:02:46.574
The fire's completely out.

00:02:46.574 --> 00:02:50.274
The temperature in the tank needs
to come down a little more, but...

00:02:50.274 --> 00:02:52.144
it's not in any danger of burning.

00:02:52.644 --> 00:02:55.644
Okay, that's mission accomplished, right?

00:02:55.644 --> 00:02:57.374
Let's go home!

00:03:00.924 --> 00:03:03.784
Man, that was so hot!

00:03:04.294 --> 00:03:06.524
My hair and clothes smell burnt.

00:03:06.524 --> 00:03:09.294
Whew! So thirsty!

00:03:09.294 --> 00:03:12.804
Good job! Total success on this mission!

00:03:12.804 --> 00:03:15.204
Now, if we can just keep this up.

00:03:15.434 --> 00:03:17.134
Don't just start relaxing!

00:03:17.134 --> 00:03:19.204
You've still got a check-up after this!

00:03:19.204 --> 00:03:21.104
You're still on duty till you're back home!

00:03:21.474 --> 00:03:24.464
Quit busting on us for little stuff!
You're so annoying!

00:03:34.524 --> 00:03:37.754
Forgot their limiters were still off...

00:03:42.664 --> 00:03:44.094
Examination, complete!

00:03:44.464 --> 00:03:46.704
No abnormalities in any of them.

00:03:46.704 --> 00:03:49.564
Okay, girls, you'll all set.

00:03:59.384 --> 00:04:02.644
Well, look at the time. You can't blame them.

00:04:03.014 --> 00:04:05.814
They really worked hard today.

00:04:06.284 --> 00:04:08.124
You got tomorrow off, right?

00:04:08.124 --> 00:04:11.294
C'mon, let's find some chicks and party now!

00:04:11.294 --> 00:04:13.694
I know this place where the gals are hot!

00:04:13.694 --> 00:04:17.794
Look, honestly, I'm really
wiped out from today, too.

00:04:18.334 --> 00:04:21.064
I'm headed home and going straight to bed.

00:04:21.064 --> 00:04:23.404
Man, what a stick in the mud.

00:04:23.404 --> 00:04:26.704
I'll write up the report. You, take care of the girls.

00:04:26.704 --> 00:04:28.074
Yes, Doctor.

00:05:01.644 --> 00:05:05.634
I gotta get this room unpacked tomorrow.

00:05:28.204 --> 00:05:32.734
Who are these guys?!
Do they know I'm with BABEL?

00:05:48.354 --> 00:05:49.654
Hello, Chief?

00:05:49.654 --> 00:05:53.024
Understood! I'll send
The Children to you at once!

00:05:53.164 --> 00:05:56.654
But sir, won't that take too long?

00:05:56.894 --> 00:05:58.694
There's nothing to worry about.

00:05:58.694 --> 00:06:00.104
Huh?

00:06:00.104 --> 00:06:00.564
READY ROOM

00:06:00.564 --> 00:06:01.834
READY ROOM
Because you came in so late tonight.

00:06:01.834 --> 00:06:02.634
Because you came in so late tonight.

00:06:02.634 --> 00:06:05.574
They asked to spend the night
at the quarters here at HQ.

00:06:05.574 --> 00:06:07.344
I'll dispatch them at once!

00:06:07.344 --> 00:06:09.104
Roger that.

00:06:09.474 --> 00:06:12.034
The Children... Released.

00:06:14.144 --> 00:06:15.674
Here we are!

00:06:18.284 --> 00:06:20.924
Whoa, fast! Way, way too fast!

00:06:20.924 --> 00:06:23.014
Wha? Hey! Kaoru, wait!

00:06:23.154 --> 00:06:25.684
Hi, guys! Great job, everyone!

00:06:26.964 --> 00:06:27.684
Yo!

00:06:28.924 --> 00:06:29.654
Yo!

00:06:29.994 --> 00:06:31.594
Wh-What?

00:06:31.594 --> 00:06:34.624
They're from BABEL's special
construction division.

00:06:34.864 --> 00:06:37.504
They do reinforcement of quarters for espers.

00:06:37.504 --> 00:06:39.604
Why are they doing that here?

00:06:39.604 --> 00:06:42.734
Looks like they're all done
in this little room here!

00:06:43.044 --> 00:06:45.734
Then lets put all of Minamoto's luggage in there!

00:06:48.714 --> 00:06:50.844
What are you girls doing?!

00:06:51.484 --> 00:06:52.784
All set?

00:06:52.784 --> 00:06:53.614
Yo!

00:06:53.754 --> 00:06:56.084
Watch out! We're bringing our stuff in now!

00:07:02.294 --> 00:07:05.264
Don't... Don't tell me, you're!

00:07:05.694 --> 00:07:09.654
You're planning to live here?!

00:07:09.904 --> 00:07:11.104
Got a problem with that?

00:07:11.104 --> 00:07:14.074
We already got permission from the Chief.

00:07:14.074 --> 00:07:17.144
Here you go, the official
change of residence forms.

00:07:17.144 --> 00:07:18.704
You can handle the formalities.

00:07:22.644 --> 00:07:24.554
We need your hanko stamp here.

00:07:24.554 --> 00:07:26.154
Can I just sign it?

00:07:26.154 --> 00:07:27.414
Sure.

00:07:28.554 --> 00:07:30.614
Thanks, and call us again for any-

00:07:33.194 --> 00:07:36.934
He hardly has any stuff. A one-room
apartment would have been fine.

00:07:36.934 --> 00:07:41.664
This was the closest place to BABEL
HQ he could move into immediately.

00:07:41.664 --> 00:07:44.154
Hm? I found something fun!

00:07:45.474 --> 00:07:47.634
It's his elementary school graduation album.

00:07:48.704 --> 00:07:51.674
I want to see Mr. Minamoto
in elementary school!

00:07:52.274 --> 00:07:53.244
Ah, here we go.

00:07:53.244 --> 00:07:53.944
6th GRADE - CLASS 2
Ah, here we go.

00:07:53.944 --> 00:07:54.844
6th GRADE - CLASS 2
Oh, lame! Must've caught a
cold on class picture day.

00:07:54.844 --> 00:07:58.944
Oh, lame! Must've caught a
cold on class picture day.

00:07:59.424 --> 00:08:01.084
Let me see it.

00:08:04.424 --> 00:08:08.164
Minamoto is already studying
above high school level.

00:08:08.164 --> 00:08:11.664
He needs to go into a program
for gifted students.

00:08:11.664 --> 00:08:16.504
To be blunt, having him here
is bothersome for us.

00:08:18.874 --> 00:08:20.344
What's wrong, Shiho?

00:08:20.344 --> 00:08:24.834
Now look, girls. You can't just barge
into a person's home and... Hm?

00:08:26.684 --> 00:08:27.574
Hey!

00:08:28.444 --> 00:08:29.344
Minamoto!

00:08:30.854 --> 00:08:32.784
This is my home.

00:08:32.784 --> 00:08:35.584
Go back to your own homes!

00:08:36.524 --> 00:08:37.724
Mr. Minamoto!

00:08:37.724 --> 00:08:40.194
C'mon, Minamoto. We got permission, so-

00:08:40.194 --> 00:08:43.754
Shut up! This isn't your home! Get out of here!

00:08:44.764 --> 00:08:47.234
You don't have to be so mean about it!

00:08:51.874 --> 00:08:53.534
Mr. Minamoto, you jerk!

00:08:58.544 --> 00:09:00.744
MEMORY ALBUM - Graduation Commemoration

00:09:00.744 --> 00:09:03.054
MEMORY ALBUM - Graduation Commemoration
I didn't think he'd be so mad about it.

00:09:03.054 --> 00:09:04.114
JINKOTSU SHOPPING ARCADE

00:09:04.114 --> 00:09:04.684
JINKOTSU SHOPPING ARCADE
Man, he really pisses me off!

00:09:04.684 --> 00:09:07.384
Man, he really pisses me off!

00:09:13.224 --> 00:09:15.394
He turned our limiters on.

00:09:15.394 --> 00:09:17.864
Oh, I am SO pissed off, now!

00:09:18.794 --> 00:09:20.464
GAMES!

00:09:20.864 --> 00:09:23.174
C'mon, let's have some fun!

00:09:23.174 --> 00:09:24.634
But, what about money?

00:09:24.634 --> 00:09:27.644
What are you talking about? We're espers.

00:09:27.644 --> 00:09:29.434
Wait, you mean?

00:09:34.114 --> 00:09:35.844
Hold it.

00:09:35.844 --> 00:09:40.754
Sorry, I can't let in any espers
over Level 2 without limiters.

00:09:40.754 --> 00:09:42.054
Limiters?

00:09:42.224 --> 00:09:44.154
But, we've got them.

00:09:44.154 --> 00:09:47.724
Limiters can only lower you down
a maximum of three levels.

00:09:47.724 --> 00:09:48.394
LEVEL 7 - Able to destroy objects, fly.

00:09:48.394 --> 00:09:48.964
LEVEL 7 - Able to destroy objects, fly.
We're Level 4's now.

00:09:48.964 --> 00:09:49.894
We're Level 4's now.

00:09:49.894 --> 00:09:50.694
LEVEL 4 - Can knock over a vase,
sense people who are walking.
Most can surprisingly project selves outside.
We're Level 4's now.

00:09:50.694 --> 00:09:51.434
LEVEL 4 - Can knock over a vase,
sense people who are walking.
Most can surprisingly project selves outside.

00:09:51.434 --> 00:09:51.894
LEVEL 4 - Can knock over a vase,
sense people who are walking.
Most can surprisingly project selves outside.
We can play a crane game
at least, can't we?

00:09:51.894 --> 00:09:53.564
We can play a crane game
at least, can't we?

00:09:53.564 --> 00:09:55.364
We want to kill some time.

00:09:55.704 --> 00:09:58.064
Kill some time?

00:09:58.204 --> 00:09:59.834
Why aren't you in school?

00:10:00.874 --> 00:10:02.894
Where do you live?

00:10:03.214 --> 00:10:06.304
You aren't runaways, are you?

00:10:07.414 --> 00:10:10.114
Tell me your names and your school.

00:10:11.584 --> 00:10:12.604
Huh?

00:10:14.484 --> 00:10:16.254
I guess elementary school kids

00:10:16.254 --> 00:10:19.324
don't usually go wandering
around at this time of day.

00:10:19.324 --> 00:10:22.294
So, what now? Go back to HQ?

00:10:24.194 --> 00:10:26.604
Or back to Mr Minamoto's place?

00:10:26.604 --> 00:10:29.894
I don't want to do either! What we need to do is...

00:10:33.174 --> 00:10:35.074
What's this?

00:10:40.714 --> 00:10:41.414
KANEGURA BANK

00:10:41.414 --> 00:10:43.054
KANEGURA BANK
Bank?

00:10:43.054 --> 00:10:43.344
KANEGURA BANK

00:10:44.314 --> 00:10:46.654
You can't just authorize that, Chief!

00:10:47.024 --> 00:10:49.684
Why do I have to sacrifice my private life, too?!

00:10:50.094 --> 00:10:52.494
Well, you see...

00:10:52.494 --> 00:10:56.624
I thought there were certain advantages to
having the entire team living together.

00:10:57.464 --> 00:11:01.434
It's inefficient to have you meet
every time we send you out, right?

00:11:01.434 --> 00:11:04.774
Aoi has to come here all the
way from Kyoto, after all.

00:11:04.774 --> 00:11:07.974
Then they can live at BABEL HQ, couldn't they?!

00:11:07.974 --> 00:11:09.674
You have plenty of rooms here!

00:11:09.674 --> 00:11:13.204
But The Children wanted to live with you.

00:11:13.614 --> 00:11:15.844
It's their desire.

00:11:16.514 --> 00:11:17.914
Their?

00:11:17.914 --> 00:11:21.654
One they've never expressed until now.

00:11:21.654 --> 00:11:24.684
You're the only one they've ever liked.

00:11:26.254 --> 00:11:29.634
Even so, I'm a complete stranger!

00:11:29.634 --> 00:11:32.594
Surely it'd be better for kids their age...

00:11:32.594 --> 00:11:36.204
to live with their families, who understand them.

00:11:36.204 --> 00:11:38.674
I wonder about that.

00:11:38.674 --> 00:11:41.304
What do you mean, Capt. Kashiwagi?

00:11:41.844 --> 00:11:46.474
Wouldn't you understand their feelings
more than their families could?

00:11:47.214 --> 00:11:50.384
Not only what it's like to have an
ability that surpasses others,

00:11:50.384 --> 00:11:52.444
but to also feel like you don't belong anywhere.

00:11:53.454 --> 00:11:57.184
To be blunt, having him here
is bothersome for us.

00:12:02.764 --> 00:12:04.064
What's wrong?

00:12:04.064 --> 00:12:05.994
Emergency dispatch from Precog!

00:12:05.994 --> 00:12:08.534
There's a 72% probability of The Children...

00:12:08.534 --> 00:12:11.634
being involved in a bank robbery
in the next 5 minutes.

00:12:11.634 --> 00:12:12.774
What?!

00:12:12.774 --> 00:12:15.364
You don't suppose... You don't suppose that!

00:12:16.104 --> 00:12:20.014
My throwing them out has
driven them to despair?!

00:12:23.414 --> 00:12:25.884
Try to say "happy" when you feel that way.

00:12:29.384 --> 00:12:30.874
Want to go to the beach?

00:12:32.424 --> 00:12:36.384
We're detecting a Level 4 esper at the
Kanegura Bank Nishiguchi branch.

00:12:37.264 --> 00:12:39.164
KANEGURA BANK

00:12:41.704 --> 00:12:45.194
Okay, any funny moves, and you die!

00:12:49.444 --> 00:12:50.744
That feather...

00:12:53.284 --> 00:12:55.214
It's like it was leading us here.

00:12:55.214 --> 00:12:56.774
Okay, let's go!

00:12:57.584 --> 00:12:59.344
Welcome.

00:13:01.584 --> 00:13:02.954
The heck?

00:13:02.954 --> 00:13:04.714
Kaoru! Above us!

00:13:06.194 --> 00:13:08.424
Whoa! Great view!

00:13:08.424 --> 00:13:10.434
SO not the right reaction...

00:13:10.434 --> 00:13:12.364
Quit screwing around!

00:13:13.404 --> 00:13:16.334
Get the money ready! Move it!

00:13:16.334 --> 00:13:18.874
Don't you care about these people?!

00:13:18.874 --> 00:13:21.644
Esper. And a psychokinetic, to boot.

00:13:21.644 --> 00:13:23.544
About a Level 4, I'd say.

00:13:23.544 --> 00:13:25.634
This is a heck of a scene to wander into.

00:13:29.414 --> 00:13:31.314
They're here already?!

00:13:37.454 --> 00:13:39.094
We're trapped!

00:13:39.094 --> 00:13:41.324
Everyone in here is my hostage!

00:13:41.764 --> 00:13:44.284
Do what I say! Is that clear?!

00:13:52.604 --> 00:13:53.804
Too late!

00:13:53.804 --> 00:13:56.244
Tokiwa. Nogaki. You're up!

00:13:56.244 --> 00:13:57.474
Yes, sir!
Yes, sir!

00:14:07.124 --> 00:14:11.984
Single suspect... Young guy. No weapons.

00:14:12.354 --> 00:14:16.094
15 hostages, all tied with rope.

00:14:16.094 --> 00:14:16.924
And The Children?!
15 hostages, all tied with rope.

00:14:20.234 --> 00:14:22.504
They're with the hostages.

00:14:22.504 --> 00:14:25.374
Looks like they were just
caught in the middle of this.

00:14:25.374 --> 00:14:28.944
Oh, I see. They're just hostages.

00:14:28.944 --> 00:14:33.244
Naturally, even if they were the perps,
I'd do everything to cover it up.

00:14:33.244 --> 00:14:34.834
That's not the problem!

00:14:36.114 --> 00:14:39.984
Looks like the suspect's psychic
powers only recently awakened.

00:14:41.284 --> 00:14:43.254
An unregistered esper.

00:14:43.254 --> 00:14:45.754
Psychokinetic, approximately Level 4.

00:14:45.754 --> 00:14:47.924
Meaning he's got some serious power.

00:14:47.924 --> 00:14:50.224
Looks like he's been pulling
some random crimes,

00:14:50.464 --> 00:14:53.464
and isn't thinking about anything
but how to get out of this.

00:14:53.464 --> 00:14:55.794
He has no idea what he's going to do.

00:14:56.264 --> 00:14:59.634
Minamoto! Send The Children into action!

00:15:00.144 --> 00:15:01.274
Chief...

00:15:01.274 --> 00:15:02.904
It's possible that their power...

00:15:02.904 --> 00:15:06.244
can contain this incident without
harming anyone around them.

00:15:06.244 --> 00:15:08.474
I... suppose, but...

00:15:09.114 --> 00:15:12.214
But it's hard to give them orders so
soon after having a fight with them?

00:15:12.214 --> 00:15:14.844
No. Duty is duty.

00:15:19.354 --> 00:15:20.664
Aoi, do you hear me?

00:15:20.664 --> 00:15:22.384
Mr. Minamoto?

00:15:22.924 --> 00:15:24.964
I'm releasing your limiters.

00:15:24.964 --> 00:15:27.994
Use force to arrest the suspect. That's an order.

00:15:28.304 --> 00:15:30.364
Order, huh? Hey!

00:15:32.374 --> 00:15:34.104
Here's the plan...

00:15:34.104 --> 00:15:36.274
The suspect's approaching The Children!

00:15:36.274 --> 00:15:37.114
What?

00:15:37.114 --> 00:15:40.344
You three! What are you talking about?

00:15:40.344 --> 00:15:45.014
I was wondering what elementary school
kids were doing here at this hour.

00:15:46.414 --> 00:15:48.514
Wait, are those?

00:15:51.024 --> 00:15:54.054
Oh! You guys are espers too, huh?

00:15:55.764 --> 00:15:59.564
I see. These are your limiters, huh?

00:16:01.034 --> 00:16:04.604
Couldn't stand being in school
and went for a little walk, huh?

00:16:04.604 --> 00:16:07.074
I know how you feel.

00:16:08.274 --> 00:16:10.344
I was the same.

00:16:10.344 --> 00:16:14.304
'Cept I was never much of a
student in the first place.

00:16:16.954 --> 00:16:19.914
Then, one day, I suddenly had this power.

00:16:21.454 --> 00:16:24.024
At first, everyone thought it was pretty cool,

00:16:24.024 --> 00:16:27.654
but soon they got scared and told
me to stay away from them.

00:16:28.464 --> 00:16:32.364
There was no place for me,
at school or at home.

00:16:33.034 --> 00:16:37.594
Same for you, right? You're here because
it's hard to be at school or at home.

00:16:38.334 --> 00:16:41.864
What do you say? Why don't we fellow
espers help each other out?

00:16:43.104 --> 00:16:46.634
If you've got no place to go, we can
hightail it to another country.

00:16:47.714 --> 00:16:51.514
Try to tempt my beloved Children, will he?!

00:16:51.514 --> 00:16:53.324
Unforgivable! Unforgivable!

00:16:53.324 --> 00:16:54.654
Chief!

00:16:54.654 --> 00:16:55.054
Sir, stop! Please!

00:16:55.054 --> 00:16:57.094
They're national treasures!
Sir, stop! Please!

00:16:57.094 --> 00:16:58.524
They're national treasures!

00:17:00.494 --> 00:17:03.184
See? I told you this would be amusing.

00:17:03.464 --> 00:17:07.624
You're just watching. You've
got some weird tastes.

00:17:08.804 --> 00:17:11.894
Now then, how will the Queen choose?

00:17:14.774 --> 00:17:18.614
Supervisor Minamoto!
You need to encourage them.

00:17:18.614 --> 00:17:20.684
Those girls are confused.

00:17:20.684 --> 00:17:23.444
It's not impossible that they may end
up going along with the suspect.

00:17:25.384 --> 00:17:27.014
Supervisor!

00:17:29.254 --> 00:17:32.124
The Children... released!

00:17:36.324 --> 00:17:37.464
Our limiters.

00:17:37.464 --> 00:17:38.724
They've been released.

00:17:40.204 --> 00:17:41.864
Minamoto...

00:17:41.864 --> 00:17:46.164
Well? What's it gonna be, little ladies?

00:17:49.074 --> 00:17:50.374
Kaoru?

00:17:52.244 --> 00:17:55.404
This isn't your home! Get out of here!

00:17:56.614 --> 00:17:57.884
I!

00:17:57.884 --> 00:17:59.814
Kaoru?

00:18:00.354 --> 00:18:03.884
When I touched Mr. Minamoto's album before...

00:18:05.154 --> 00:18:07.644
I saw something from his childhood.

00:18:08.794 --> 00:18:10.284
Really?

00:18:12.694 --> 00:18:16.364
Minamoto's is already studying
above high school level.

00:18:16.774 --> 00:18:19.604
He needs to go into a program
for gifted students.

00:18:19.974 --> 00:18:23.464
But, sir. He's...

00:18:23.974 --> 00:18:27.244
I know this is hard to hear, ma'am, but...

00:18:27.314 --> 00:18:31.944
To be blunt, having him here
is bothersome for us.

00:18:33.724 --> 00:18:36.724
He's destroying the morale of the other students.

00:18:36.724 --> 00:18:39.794
It makes running the school difficult.

00:18:39.794 --> 00:18:41.664
Teacher...

00:18:41.664 --> 00:18:46.224
I... I just want to stay here, like the normal kids.

00:18:48.004 --> 00:18:50.294
I'm sorry.

00:18:54.874 --> 00:18:57.534
That's why, when the photo was taken...

00:18:58.974 --> 00:19:02.074
Mr. Minamoto had already left the school.

00:19:02.914 --> 00:19:05.554
He wasn't out sick...

00:19:05.554 --> 00:19:09.314
That's why he got so mad when
we started looking at it.

00:19:11.854 --> 00:19:12.954
Okay!

00:19:13.324 --> 00:19:15.554
Aoi, Shiho, let's do this!

00:19:20.264 --> 00:19:22.804
Okay, we're with you.

00:19:22.804 --> 00:19:24.894
Oh, really?

00:19:26.074 --> 00:19:29.234
However, you're coming with US!

00:19:34.384 --> 00:19:36.314
Where are we?

00:19:36.444 --> 00:19:41.354
The safest place the three of
us could teleport you to...

00:19:41.784 --> 00:19:43.694
Safe?

00:19:43.694 --> 00:19:46.484
Safe for us to do THIS to you!

00:19:51.094 --> 00:19:53.904
Who... Who the hell?!

00:19:53.904 --> 00:19:57.594
Who are we? Well, we are...

00:19:57.904 --> 00:20:00.064
BABEL's special esper team.

00:20:00.274 --> 00:20:02.634
The Children!

00:20:03.974 --> 00:20:06.504
Special espers, huh?!

00:20:07.114 --> 00:20:09.744
You tricked me!

00:20:19.394 --> 00:20:20.964
He pushed back.

00:20:20.964 --> 00:20:22.094
Not bad for a Level 4.

00:20:22.094 --> 00:20:24.224
But no match for Level 7's!

00:20:30.034 --> 00:20:31.934
You freaks!

00:20:40.544 --> 00:20:42.674
What's with this glass?

00:20:43.144 --> 00:20:44.984
This room, very recently...

00:20:44.984 --> 00:20:46.684
Just this morning, in fact.

00:20:46.684 --> 00:20:49.624
Was reinforced with anti-ESP construction.

00:20:49.824 --> 00:20:53.914
A Level 4 can't break through
the walls and glass in here.

00:20:56.064 --> 00:20:58.494
And there you have it, Mr. Minamoto.

00:20:58.764 --> 00:21:01.034
You can handle the rest.

00:21:01.034 --> 00:21:03.404
Understood. Good job.

00:21:11.644 --> 00:21:13.444
Go on, inside.

00:21:17.314 --> 00:21:19.454
Case closed, huh?

00:21:19.454 --> 00:21:20.454
Yup.

00:21:20.454 --> 00:21:22.184
C'mon, let's head home.

00:21:22.184 --> 00:21:26.654
I just realized, we were up
all night. I'm really tired.

00:21:26.654 --> 00:21:28.994
You're right. Let's get out of here.

00:21:28.994 --> 00:21:31.654
Where are you three going?

00:21:32.264 --> 00:21:33.564
Where?

00:21:33.564 --> 00:21:35.304
We're going home.

00:21:35.304 --> 00:21:38.234
This is your home, isn't it?

00:21:42.404 --> 00:21:44.774
Now, let's get those messy
rooms straightened up...

00:21:44.774 --> 00:21:47.214
and your bedding laid out.

00:21:47.214 --> 00:21:48.944
You mean?

00:21:48.944 --> 00:21:52.384
Well, I can't very well have you
wandering around outside

00:21:52.384 --> 00:21:54.614
and getting into trouble again, can I?

00:21:55.254 --> 00:21:56.354
Minamoto!

00:21:56.354 --> 00:21:57.894
All right!

00:21:57.894 --> 00:22:00.294
Now we can be together,
even when we're off duty!

00:22:04.164 --> 00:22:06.694
C'mon, let's all go home.

00:22:06.694 --> 00:22:08.324
Yes!

00:22:19.474 --> 00:22:24.614
There's no point in hiding it

00:22:24.914 --> 00:22:28.974
I know everything

00:22:29.724 --> 00:22:35.164
It's no mystery, because

00:22:35.524 --> 00:22:40.934
I love you

00:22:41.164 --> 00:22:45.574
Go on, look at me

00:22:45.834 --> 00:22:50.144
Truly, the bond of love we share

00:22:50.144 --> 00:22:52.114
Is absolute!

00:22:52.344 --> 00:22:57.054
An eternal, unchanging

00:22:57.054 --> 00:23:03.694
Absolute declaration to the world
I'll shout from Everest!

00:23:03.694 --> 00:23:08.524
I've accepted it

00:23:08.524 --> 00:23:12.934
The bond of love we share

00:23:12.934 --> 00:23:15.134
Is absolute!

00:23:15.134 --> 00:23:19.574
My wish, when fortune smiles on me

00:23:19.874 --> 00:23:23.974
In San Pietro, I'll swear it to you

00:23:23.974 --> 00:23:26.774
An absolute declaration of love!

00:23:39.954 --> 00:23:40.894
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:40.894 --> 00:23:42.964
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.964 --> 00:23:47.424
Naomi's fallen into a serious slump!
She can't use her ESP well at all.

00:23:47.664 --> 00:23:51.434
It's my fault a criminal escaped and
Supervisor Tanizaki was injured.

00:23:51.434 --> 00:23:53.004
Naomi really is a nice person.

00:23:53.004 --> 00:23:54.574
With such big boobs!

00:23:54.574 --> 00:23:56.804
Kaoru, you're drooling.

00:23:56.804 --> 00:23:59.644
Zettai Karen Children, episode 4!

00:23:59.644 --> 00:24:02.544
An Enchanting Sight of Spring!
Go, Go, Pretty High School Girl!

00:24:02.544 --> 00:24:04.984
Something's coming! Something in
my heart that's holding me back!

00:24:04.984 --> 00:24:05.614
An Enchanting Sight of Spring!
Go, Go, Pretty High School Girl!
Something's coming! Something in
my heart that's holding me back!

00:24:05.614 --> 00:24:08.324
An Enchanting Sight of Spring!
Go, Go, Pretty High School Girl!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

